{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:13b554fe3303253b","name":"Force Point Recovery","source":{"id":"source:reference-13b554fe3303253b","title":"Force Point Recovery","revision":24973,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:32:31Z","sha256":"2ad9c3f247fef01347fe00c5ab42ba6129875841a6f096310a8735dd2f2e7b95","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24973","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Force%20Point%20Recovery&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-13b554fe3303253b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At the end of an encounter, you automatically recover 1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," spent during the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Recovering Temporary Force Points"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," If you gain a temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," (such as with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Fringe Savant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fringe_Savant"}]}," Talent) and you also have the Force Point Recovery Force Technique, can you gain a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," by \"recovering\" the temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," that you spent?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," No. Temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," are just that- temporary- and they cannot be recovered by any means after the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Atonement and Force Point Recovery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," If you have Force Point Recovery and you atone to reduce your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},", do you get the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," back?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," No. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," that you sacrifice for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Atonement"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Atonement"}," are permanently lost and cannot be recovered by any means.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
